  << /ActualText (NeuraLyfe\nFigBuild 2026 \267 1st Place of 690 Teams \267 \04410K Grand Prize\nDesigned an AI\055enabled neurotechnology decision\055support system that translates helmet impact data into real\055time neurological risk insights for sideline medical staff\056\nStructured the diagnosis flow into three progressive views so non\055specialist staff can act within seconds\nPrototyped real\055time risk monitoring in Figma Make\054 pairing live sensor data with AI\055generated summaries\nEncoded neurological metrics into visual signals and alert states readable at a glance)
