  << /ActualText (Spatial Editor \055 Capstone Project\nNew Paradigm for XR Text Input \nDesigned a new interaction paradigm for text input in XR\054 rethinking current high\055friction methods through faster\054 multimodal alternatives\056\nDefined the problem space\054 identifying text input as XR\047s highest\055friction task through a competitive teardown of 2 input methods\nObserved 8 Vision Pro and Quest users and ran interviews to map real\055world friction patterns\nPrototyped 2 interaction concepts in Xcode\054 converging on a multimodal model that pairs predictive AI with gaze\055led targeting\nValidated the model with 10 users in usability testing)
