  << /ActualText (Aura\nMotion Sickness Relief System  \nDesigned a sensor\055driven wearable that reduces motion sickness through anticipatory sensory feedback\054 intervening before symptoms onset\056\nReframed relief from reactive treatment to anticipatory care\054 using real\055time HRV data to detect early autonomic stress before discomfort begins\nDesigned the sensing\055to\055feedback loop\054 triggering 100 Hz sound stimulation grounded in published vestibular research on motion sickness\nDefined the wearable form factor for inflight use\054 balancing sensor placement against long\055haul wear comfort)
